The director undertakes a review of the constitutional documents and governance structure as follows:
• Memorandum and Articles of Association (Standard Chartered Bank Kenya Limited);
• Board and Management structure;
• Subsidiary governance structure (Committees);
• Board Charter;
• Board and Committee TORs
• Schedule of matters reserved for the Board
• Executive Committee/ Management Committee Terms of Reference (TOR)
• Any other Committee TORs as applicable.
• Board and Committee meeting dates;
• Rolling agenda for Board and Committee meetings; and
• Board diversity.
